    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lovely Anime Puzzle: Patrick is a delightful puzzle game featuring charming anime-style girls in festive St. Patrick Day attire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is to assemble images of these adorable characters, which have been divided into a set number of puzzle pieces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game offers 4 difficulty levels that progressively increase the challenge and add new excitement. Regardless of the chosen difficulty, you\u2019ll enjoy high-quality artwork showcasing the vibrant holiday theme.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key features of Lovely Anime Puzzle: Patrick:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 50 engaging levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Beautiful Patrick-themed artwork</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Intuitive mouse controls</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Achievements to unlock</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Relaxing background music</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513970/extras/db11c8849b814893b5afadedac2381c6.poster.avif?t=1745433902\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513970/extras/db11c8849b814893b5afadedac2381c6.webm?t=1745433902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lovely Anime Puzzle: Patrick is a delightful puzzle game featuring charming anime-style girls in festive St. Patrick Day attire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is to assemble images of these adorable characters, which have been divided into a set number of puzzle pieces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game offers 4 difficulty levels that progressively increase the challenge and add new excitement. Regardless of the chosen difficulty, you\u2019ll enjoy high-quality artwork showcasing the vibrant holiday theme.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key features of Lovely Anime Puzzle: Patrick:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 50 engaging levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Beautiful Patrick-themed artwork</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Intuitive mouse controls</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Achievements to unlock</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Relaxing background music</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513970/extras/db11c8849b814893b5afadedac2381c6.poster.avif?t=1745433902\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513970/extras/db11c8849b814893b5afadedac2381c6.webm?t=1745433902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
